{"id":"a03c2828834ee687","group":"20","path":"20/20-df-basis.md","title":"基、非基与反基","display":"df-basis — 基、非基与反基","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-df-basis","aliases":["20-df-basis"],"display":"df-basis — 基、非基与反基","chapter":"9","section":"9.1","source_kind":"book","verification_status":"reviewed","source_reference":"Definition 9.1.2","source_pdf_pages":[207],"source_printed_pages":[175],"depends_on":["[[20-df-closed-class]]","[[20-df-deg]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-df-basis"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-df-basis</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-basis — 基、非基与反基"},{"key":"chapter","html":"9"},{"key":"section","html":"9.1"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"reviewed"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Definition 9.1.2"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>207</span></div>"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>175</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b73290a0af01d44f\" href=\"?note=b73290a0af01d44f\" title=\"20-df-closed-class\">20-df-closed-class</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"c98b19cc764c238f\" href=\"?note=c98b19cc764c238f\" title=\"20-df-deg\">20-df-deg</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal B\\subseteq2^\\omega\">\\(\\mathcal B\\subseteq2^\\omega\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\\subseteq\\mathcal D\">\\(D\\subseteq\\mathcal D\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"b73290a0af01d44f\" href=\"?note=b73290a0af01d44f\" title=\"20-df-closed-class\">20-df-closed-class</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"c98b19cc764c238f\" href=\"?note=c98b19cc764c238f\" title=\"20-df-deg\">20-df-deg</a>。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\\subseteq2^\\omega\">\\(C\\subseteq2^\\omega\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\in2^\\omega\">\\(X\\in2^\\omega\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}basis}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\n\\operatorname{Basis}(\\mathcal B)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall C\\ [\\operatorname{Pi01Class}(C)\\land C\\ne\\varnothing\\Rightarrow C\\cap\\mathcal B\\ne\\varnothing],\\\\\n\\operatorname{DegreeBasis}(D)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{Basis}(\\{X\\in2^\\omega:\\deg_T(X)\\in D\\}),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Antibasis}(D)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall C\\\n[\\operatorname{Pi01Class}(C)\\land\n(\\forall\\mathbf d\\in D\\ \\exists X\\in C\\ \\deg_T(X)=\\mathbf d)\n\\Rightarrow\\forall\\mathbf d\\in\\mathcal D\\ \\exists X\\in C\\ \\deg_T(X)=\\mathbf d].\n\\end{gathered}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}basis}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\n\\operatorname{Basis}(\\mathcal B)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall C\\ [\\operatorname{Pi01Class}(C)\\land C\\ne\\varnothing\\Rightarrow C\\cap\\mathcal B\\ne\\varnothing],\\\\\n\\operatorname{DegreeBasis}(D)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{Basis}(\\{X\\in2^\\omega:\\deg_T(X)\\in D\\}),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Antibasis}(D)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall C\\\n[\\operatorname{Pi01Class}(C)\\land\n(\\forall\\mathbf d\\in D\\ \\exists X\\in C\\ \\deg_T(X)=\\mathbf d)\n\\Rightarrow\\forall\\mathbf d\\in\\mathcal D\\ \\exists X\\in C\\ \\deg_T(X)=\\mathbf d].\n\\end{gathered}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>Nonbasis 是 DegreeBasis 的否定。Antibasis 涉及每个指定度的代表元，不能改成“至少有某个指定度的成员”。</p>\n<p>来源：Definition 9.1.2；印刷页 175；PDF 第 207 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-closed-class","status":"resolved","id":"b73290a0af01d44f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-closed-class]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-deg","status":"resolved","id":"c98b19cc764c238f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-deg]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-closed-class","status":"resolved","id":"b73290a0af01d44f","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-closed-class]]；see [[20-df-deg]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-deg","status":"resolved","id":"c98b19cc764c238f","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-closed-class]]；see [[20-df-deg]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal B\\subseteq2^\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"D\\subseteq\\mathcal D","display":false},{"tex":"C\\subseteq2^\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"X\\in2^\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}basis}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\n\\operatorname{Basis}(\\mathcal B)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall C\\ [\\operatorname{Pi01Class}(C)\\land C\\ne\\varnothing\\Rightarrow C\\cap\\mathcal B\\ne\\varnothing],\\\\\n\\operatorname{DegreeBasis}(D)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{Basis}(\\{X\\in2^\\omega:\\deg_T(X)\\in D\\}),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Antibasis}(D)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall C\\\n[\\operatorname{Pi01Class}(C)\\land\n(\\forall\\mathbf d\\in D\\ \\exists X\\in C\\ \\deg_T(X)=\\mathbf d)\n\\Rightarrow\\forall\\mathbf d\\in\\mathcal D\\ \\exists X\\in C\\ \\deg_T(X)=\\mathbf d].\n\\end{gathered}","display":true}],"bytes":1478,"backlinks":[{"id":"cc21d215609a3083","anchor":"ref-12","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-closed-class]]；see [[20-df-basis]]；see [[20-df-re]]；see [[20-df-K]]；see [[20-thm-simple-exists]]；see [[20-df-effective-immune]]；see [[20-thm-hyperimmune-bound]]；see [[20-df-finite-array]]；see [[20-thm-closed-class-tree-equivalence]]；see [[20-thm-effective-immune-ce-upper]]。"},{"id":"d467a7b6bbdb1c63","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-basis]]；see [[20-df-low-high]]；see [[20-df-oracle-numbering]]；see [[20-df-use]]；see [[20-thm-K-one-complete]]；see [[20-thm-jump]]；see [[20-lem-functional-perfect-embedding]]；see [[20-thm-perfect-embedding-degrees]]。"},{"id":"d85c7ced66d7ccee","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[20-df-basis]]"},{"id":"005203b6707a19f4","anchor":"ref-323","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[20-df-basis]] — 章 9；直接提供者 2 个。"},{"id":"f4368dd1e05cad1f","anchor":"ref-323","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[20-df-basis]]"}],"outgoing":["b73290a0af01d44f","c98b19cc764c238f"]}